cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use cuju in your research, please cite it and Google Research Football.
title: "cuju: a bit-exact, batched reimplementation of Google Research Football, for CUDA and CPU"
type: software
authors:
    - family-names: Koraleski
      given-names: André
version: 0.2.1
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license:
    - Apache-2.0
    - LGPL-2.1-or-later
    - MIT
    - SunPro
    - BSL-1.0
    - BSD-3-Clause
url: https://github.com/AndreKoraleski/cuju
repository-code: https://github.com/AndreKoraleski/cuju
abstract: >-
    cuju is a bit-exact, batched reimplementation of Google Research Football for CUDA and the
    CPU. For the same seed and actions, every state, observation, reward and done flag equals that
    of Google Research Football 2.10.3, bit for bit.
keywords:
    - reinforcement learning
    - multi-agent
    - google research football
    - cuda
